DTSTART:20260912T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:2nd Saturday of the month8:00 – 10:00 amFree\, but donations ap
	preciatedAll ages\, minors must be accompanied by an adult \n\n\n\nWork on
	 your bird watching skills while helping the Arboretum monitor bird popula
	tions on a fun\, relaxed morning walk. Join us on the second Saturday of e
	ach month in front of the Nature Center building for a two-hour bird surve
	y led by Arboretum staff members Kelsey Low and Theo Ostler. We welcome al
	l levels of bird watching skill and all ages (as long as you’re quiet) – b
	ut no dogs\, please!  \n\n\n\nIf you have binoculars of your own\, please 
	bring them. We have a limited number of binoculars available to borrow\n\n
	https://houstonarboretum.org/event/second-saturday-bird-survey/2026-09-12/
	\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
